            "preview": "// Input: six named entities that all involve U+226B (MUCH GREATER-THAN, ≫). // &nGg; and &nGtv; are \"negated\" forms that add a combining stroke (U+0338 ̸) after ≫. // &nGt; adds a different combining overlay (U+20D2 ⃒) after ≫."
