          {
            "start_line": 34,
            "end_line": 42,
            "line_count": 9,
            "preview": "// Expected Unicode string after unescaping all six entities. // ≫         (U+226B)                — from &NestedGreaterGreater; // ⋙̸        (U+22D9 + U+0338)       — from &nGg; (triple-greater + combining long solidus)"
          },
          {
            "start_line": 44,
            "end_line": 49,
            "line_count": 6,
            "preview": "// Re-escape the Unicode string to ASCII using the extended entity set. // The encoder uses canonical names: &Gt; for U+226B and &Gg; for U+22D9. // Combining characters (U+0338, U+20D2) have no named entity, so they become numeric hex refs"
